    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Clinically shown to help grow thicker, fuller hair in 12 weeks\r\nAs we age, more hair follicles can switch from growing normal hair to growing thinner, shorter peach fuzz, making hair appear less thick, full and healthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Nature's Bounty Optimal Solutions Hair Growth capsules have an Advanced Hair Complex that works by delivering a matrix of 3 vital nutrients to the hair follicles, providing structural support for existing hair growth, increased thickness and healthier, fuller looking hair.\r\nBiotin a B vitamin essential to hair protein synthesis\r\nArginine an amino acid in keratin\r\nSilicon a mineral found in healthy hair, nails, and skin"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "#1 brand for hair, skin & nails\r\nSource: IRI Total US - Multi Outlet: Latest 52 weeks ending 04/02/23."
